  "id": "dominican-1604-canon",
  "title": "Dominican Missal 1604: complete Canon constituent",
  "scope": "Complete Dominican Canon constituent as the 1604 book prints it: from p. 181 (PDF 245) display title CANON SACROSANCTI INCRUENTI SACRIFICII MISSAE and Te igitur through p. 185 (PDF 249) omnis honor et gloria, left column, immediately before the heading Cantus Solemnis. 15 source-order units, 26 printed crosses, no rubrics printed within these bounds. The book sets the concluding Per omnia saecula saeculorum. Amen only in the following notated chant block, which is excluded with it. Whole-book and complete-Ordinary coverage remain partial; no wording is inherited from another edition.",
